msgid "Set the current subplot panel to plot on."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../../../../.conda/lib/python3.14/site-packages/pygmt/src/subplot.py:docstring
#: of pygmt.src.subplot.set_panel:3
msgid ""
"Before you start plotting you must first select the active subplot. "
"**Note**: If any *projection* option is passed with the question mark **?** "
"as scale or width when plotting subplots, then the dimensions of the plot "
"are automatically determined by the subplot size and your region. For "
"Cartesian plots: If you want the scale to apply equally to both dimensions "
"then you must specify ``projection=\"x\"`` [The default ``projection=\"X\"`` "
"will fill the subplot by using unequal scales]."
msgstr ""

